          "java_expr": "public void updateTile(){",
          "rule": "The factory frame; carries efficiency (default 1.0), current_plan (default -1), payload (default null), progress/time/speed_scl (defaults 0.0 -- UnitBuild float fields, Java default 0f), configurable (default true) and rules_state (bannedUnits, default empty).",
